OL,3,GNEWSASnow lands in the North East and
OL,4,ACumbria
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in parts of the north east of
OL,7,FEngland and Cumbria woke up to a layer
OL,8,Fof snow, with more falling throughout
OL,9,Fthe morning.
OL,11,FIt mainly fell over the region's hills
OL,12,Fand mountains with a thick layer
OL,13,Fcovering Tow Law, County Durham, while
OL,14,FSpadeadam near Carlisle, Cumbria, saw 3
OL,15,Fcm (1 in) of snow, according to the Met
OL,16,FOffice.
OL,18,FVolunteer snowplough and gritter driver
OL,19,FKevin Shorter told BBC Radio Cumbria he
OL,20,Fwas "spinning and sliding" on the main
OL,21,Froads coming out of Nenthead near
OL,22,FAlston in the early hours.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
